会不会讨厌地对我说：蒋先生，我多么讨厌你英俊的那张脸。”看到这句话，温蔓嘴角一咧。睡在下铺的温媛翻了个身。温蔓赶紧用手捂住嘴巴，眼睛不由自主地往下扫着信纸，一字一字地读：“其实你不了解我。蔓蔓。我脖子后面，有块伤疤，很丑呢。蔓蔓，不要那么讨厌我好吗？我是那么的喜欢你。我蒋衍向天起誓，我对女人表白，这是人生中的第一次，光荣，神圣，伟大。所以，想了解我并不难，蔓蔓，让我们再再再……N次方见面吧。到时候，或许你会对我说：蒋先生，固然你那张英俊的脸能让我生气，但是，我并不讨厌你。”看完整封信，嘴角的笑意都笑进了心窝里面，暖烘烘的。如果他存心是要她笑，要她欢心，他办到了。折叠好信纸重新放回到牛皮信封里，下面的温媛忽然一声：“姐，你没睡吗？”手电筒一按，立马关了。然温媛已经发现到她没有睡，出口便是一串不饶人的埋怨：“你每天上班九点，我上课要七点半，你知道不知道？！”温蔓微皱那两条纤长柔顺的眉毛，看着漆黑的天花板说：“对不起，媛媛，我刚刚有点睡不着。”嘭一声，温媛在下铺剧烈地翻个身，这一震，让整张鸭子铺上下抖动，伴随着怒火冲天的咆哮：“你考不上好大学倒好，还想我考不上好大学吗？！”下唇紧紧地咬住道痕，温蔓压住胸口的起伏：“媛媛，如果你真有本事，考上了中央美术学院再和姐说这话！”等了许久，下面的温媛再没有敢发出声音。温蔓嘴角上浮显的笑意，一点点地掉了下来，沉入黑暗里。想到他那封信，她忽然在心里想：蒋先生，你明知道我们这个家是这样的话，还会喜欢上我吗？——大婚晚辰——蒋衍在那封平生第一次写的情书送出去后，心里快乐得像只飞翔的小鸟。当晚他失眠了，打电话给杜宇，问可不可以再把蔓蔓约出来。“今天才见面，明天又见面？”初夏吃惊。“我看他这样热忱，倒有几分真心。”杜宇对蒋衍很有信心。初夏回想后，说：“你这话说的倒没有错。至今嘛，我从没有过有人这样追过蔓蔓。”“我看啊。”杜宇侧过身，与妻子面对面商量，“不如我们找个时间，四个人到郊外游玩吧。一方面，我们两个很久没有浪漫了，另一方面，给他们制造点亲密机会。”“好啊。”初夏真心觉得这个建议很好，就应该让蔓蔓多出来走走呼吸新鲜空气，闷在那个温家，早晚得被气死。温蔓再听初夏约自己周末出来，有些戒心了：“除了你和我，还有谁？”“你负责准备郊外的野餐，其它由我来安排。”初夏耍赖。温蔓真不知道怎么说，或许是那封信在她心里扎了根。在见到蒋衍如期出现的时候，她心里并没有排斥。蒋衍借了莫文洋的东风。杜宇要开，初夏陪着老公要坐前座，余下的两人只好坐后座。行李拎上了车，是在公司门口汇合出发。坐在后座靠着车窗的温蔓，几乎是把自己的脸都贴到了冰凉的窗面上。她第一次和男人挨这么近，心里燥，脸皮子燥。蒋衍见她局促拘谨的样子，在心里一直笑，手偷偷摸摸地伸过去，指尖摸到她葱白的手指末。温蔓一惊，刚要缩回手指，却被他的指头给夹住。紧接，他手指沿着指缝插入到了她的五指间，宛如蔓藤一般缠绕起来，温暖的热流通过指尖，流入到心窝口里。车窗里的茶色玻璃，映出自己嘴角边上的笑，温蔓看见，内心里仿佛打翻了坛子什么滋味都有。“在想什么？”蒋衍发现她脸上的怔疑，不由自主地靠了过去。温蔓那小心肝儿，又是砰砰跳了好几下，他身上的味道一点点地漫入到鼻间，是清新干净的皂香，好比刚切开的柠檬。她的小脸蛋，被这柠檬给熏的，像水潮漫上了通红。在蒋衍眼里，眼前这张佳人的秀容，像是秀色可餐的红苹果，惹得他喉咙里一痒，连带小腹热了起来。他干渴地舔舔嘴唇，却见佳人这般羞涩，不敢越轨。这十只缠绕的手指，一路缠到了终点。春天的气息正浓，天气不凉不热，踏青刚刚好。沿路见着不少结伴踏青的年轻人，情侣也多。上山的时候，杜宇与初夏握着手。蔓蔓跟在后面，心里很紧张。这样的情景，让她想起大学那时。太青春，太恣意飞扬，她觉得梦幻，不实在，想她今早上还在家里数钱怎么给上北漂存钱。“蔓蔓？”一个声音缠过来在她耳边低下去，浓浓的温热气息撩着人。蔓蔓如惊弓之鸟往旁边一小跳。蒋衍真是从来没有见过这么、这么拘束的女孩子，心里面的笑不由自主地挂在嘴角，指着路旁边的花：“喜欢吗？”“喜欢——”见他做势要摘，急忙“哎”，阻止，“摘花不好。”羞答答的秀手这会儿倒是挺有勇气的，抓在他卷着半截袖子的胳膊上。等意识到了，小手又忽的收了回去，触电都没有这么快。忍不住了，实在忍不住了。一把将她的小胳膊肘一抓，他向她挑着英挺的眉，眼睛亮得像星光：“蔓蔓同志，要相信男同志是不会耍流氓的。”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dahunwanchen/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "007 Love Letter At night, Wen Man turned on the flashlight in bed, lying on the bed, and quietly took out the letter paper from the brown envelope. On the dark striped red line, the free and easy pen ink is just like his person: \"Hey, Manman, dear Manman, what should I do? Because I think about your bowl of instant noodles day and night, every day. I have been thinking about Jiang Yan for thirty years, and I have never missed anything like this. I am afraid that I am poisoned. I made a mistake and ran to the hospital. The doctor gave me a diagnosis and said: You are in trouble. You are poisoned. If the antidote is not found, the poison will invade the internal organs. When I thought about it, this doctor's words were like the symptoms of poisoning by martial arts masters in Tianlong Babu. However, when I thought about you, I couldn't believe it. It hurts inside. Even though it hurts so much, I never thought I was going to die. This may be what I, Jiang Yan, are most proud of. However, I am afraid that you hate me. It is not that I, Jiang Yan, have never tasted the feeling of being hated by others, but if I, Jiang Yan, have tasted it for the first time, that is. You, Manman. Manman, I like you. Will you blush for this sentence? I fantasize about this question every day, and I am afraid that if I ask you this question in person, you will say to me: Mr. Jiang, how much I hate your handsome face.\" Wen Man grinned when he saw this. Wen Yuan, who was sleeping on the lower bunk, turned over. Wen Man quickly covered her mouth with her hands, and scanned the letter involuntarily with her eyes, reading word for word: \"Actually, you don't know me. Man Man. There is a scar on the back of my neck, which is very ugly. Man Man, don't hate me so much, okay? I like you so much. I, Jiang Yan, swear to God that this is the first time in my life that I confess to a woman. , glorious, sacred, great. So, it’s not difficult to get to know me, Manman, let’s meet again... N times. At that time, maybe you will say to me: Mr. Jiang, although your handsome face can make me angry, but I don’t hate you.” After reading the whole letter, the smile on the corner of my mouth filled my heart. If his intention was to make her laugh and make her happy, he succeeded. After folding the letter paper and putting it back into the kraft envelope, Wen Yuan suddenly said: \"Sister, are you awake?\" She pressed the flashlight and turned it off immediately. However, Wen Yuan had already noticed that she was not sleeping, and came out with a series of unforgiving complaints: \"You go to work at nine o'clock every day, and I go to class at 7:30, do you know that?!\" Wen Man slightly wrinkled her long and soft eyebrows, looked at the dark ceiling and said, \"I'm sorry, Yuanyuan, I just couldn't sleep.\" With a bang, Wen Yuan turned over violently on the lower bunk, this shock , making the whole duck bed shake up and down, accompanied by an angry roar: \"It's better that you can't get into a good university. Do you still think that I can't get into a good university?!\" Biting her lower lip tightly, Wen Man suppressed the rise and fall of her chest: \"Yuanyuan, if you are really capable, you can get admitted to the Central Academy of Fine Arts and then say this to your sister!\" After waiting for a long time, Wen Yuan below did not dare to make a sound again. The smile that appeared on the corner of Wen Man's mouth fell away little by little and sank into the darkness. Thinking of his letter, she suddenly thought in her heart: Mr. Jiang, if you knew that our family was like this, would you still like me? ——Wedding night—— After Jiang Yan sent out the love letter he wrote for the first time in his life, he felt as happy as a flying bird. That night he couldn't sleep, so he called Du Yu and asked if he could ask Manman out again. \"We just met today and we will meet again tomorrow?\" Chu Xia was surprised. \"I see that he is so enthusiastic and sincere.\" Du Yu has great confidence in Jiang Yan. After thinking about it, Chu Xia said, \"What you said is not wrong. So far, I have never had anyone chase Manman like this.\" \"I see.\" Du Yu turned sideways and discussed with his wife face to face, \"Why don't we find a time for the four of us to go out to play in the countryside. One party On the one hand, we haven't had a romantic relationship for a long time. On the other hand, let's create some opportunities for them to be intimate.\" \"Okay.\" Chu Xia really thinks this suggestion is good. Man Man should be allowed to go out and breathe fresh air. Sooner or later, he will be pissed to death in the Wen family. When Wen Man heard Chu Xia asked her to go out on the weekend again, she became a little wary: \"Who else is there besides you and me?\" \"You are responsible for preparing the picnic in the suburbs, and I will arrange the rest.\" Chu Xia was lying. Wen Man really didn't know what to say. Maybe it was the letter that took root in her heart. When she saw Jiang Yan appear as scheduled, she was not repulsed. Jiang Yan borrowed from Mo Wenyang. Du Yu wanted to drive, Chu Xia and her husband wanted to sit in the front seat, and the remaining two had to sit in the back seat. The luggage was loaded into the car and we met at the entrance of the company to set off. Wen Man, who was sitting in the back seat and leaning against the window, almost pressed her face to the cold window. It was the first time that she was so close to a man, and she felt anxious and embarrassed. Seeing her shy and reserved look, Jiang Yan kept laughing in his heart. He reached out his hand secretly and touched the end of her green-white fingers with his fingertips. Wen Man was startled and was about to retract her fingers, but was caught by his fingers. Immediately afterwards, he inserted his fingers along the gaps between her fingers, entwining them like vines, and the warm heat flowed through the fingertips and into the pit of her heart. The brown glass in the car window reflected the smile on the corner of her mouth. When Wen Man saw it, she felt as if the jar had been overturned. \"What are you thinking about?\" Jiang Yan noticed the confusion on her face and leaned over involuntarily. Wen Man's little sweetheart jumped several times, and the smell of him spread into his nose little by little. It was a fresh and clean soapy fragrance, like a freshly cut lemon. Her little face, smoked by the lemon, turned red like water. In Jiang Yan's eyes, the beautiful face in front of him was like a delicious red apple, which made his throat itch.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}